@startuml Sequence-Utiliser-MiniSite-Metier
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor black
skinparam sequenceActorBorderColor black

title Diagramme de Séquence - Utiliser le Mini-site Métier\n

actor "Utilisateur\nMétier" as User
participant "Interface\nMini-site" as UI
participant "Contrôleur\nMini-site" as Controller
participant "Service\nDétection" as Detective
participant "Service\nAudit" as AuditService
participant "Base de\nDonnées" as DB

note over User, DB
  L'utilisateur est déjà authentifié avec session OTP valide
end note

User -> UI: Accès /intranet/users
UI -> Controller: GET /intranet/users
Controller -> DB: Récupérer student (usagers)
DB --> Controller: Liste étudiants
Controller --> UI: JSON students
UI --> User: Affiche tableau usagers

User -> UI: Clique pour consulter détail usager
UI -> Controller: GET /intranet/users/{id}
Controller -> DB: Récupérer student
DB --> Controller: Détails student
Controller --> UI: Données usager
UI --> User: Affiche fiche

User -> UI: Modifie champ texte (ex: email)
UI -> Controller: PATCH /intranet/users/{id}
note right of Controller
  Middlewares appliqués:
  - CSRF check
  - IP authorization
  - Session validity
end note

Controller -> Detective: Analyser payload (XSS, SQL injection?)
Detective -> Detective: Regex + pattern matching
Detective --> Controller: Résultat analyse

alt Contenu suspect détecté
    Detective --> Controller: DANGER detected
    Controller -> AuditService: Auditer action suspecte\n(user, action, payload, risk_level)
    AuditService -> DB: Enregistrer AuditLog\n(severity='HIGH', detected_pattern)
    DB --> AuditService: Audit enregistré
    AuditService --> Controller: Threat recorded
    
    Controller -> DB: Créer Alert
    DB --> Controller: Alert créée
    
    Controller --> UI: 403 Forbidden + Alerte SOC
    UI --> User: "Action bloquée - modération"
    
else Contenu valide
    Controller -> DB: Mettre à jour student
    DB --> Controller: Student modifié
    
    Controller -> AuditService: Auditer action nominale\n(user, entity, change, timestamp)
    AuditService -> DB: Enregistrer AuditLog\n(severity='LOW', action_type)
    DB --> AuditService: Audit enregistré
    AuditService --> Controller: Audit recorded
    
    Controller --> UI: 200 OK + confirmation
    UI --> User: "Modifications enregistrées"
end

User -> UI: Consulte services
UI -> Controller: GET /intranet/courses
Controller -> DB: Récupérer courses (services)
DB --> Controller: Liste courses
Controller --> UI: JSON courses
UI --> User: Affiche catalogue services

User -> UI: Quitte mini-site
UI -> Controller: POST /auth/logout (session_id)
Controller -> DB: Révoquer session
DB --> Controller: Session révoquée
Controller --> UI: 200 OK
UI --> User: Utilisateur déconnecté

@enduml
